s10-5-p20 : Block
s10-5-p20 = prose (cons "A consumer requiring the new snapshot, when neither reuse nor a preserving migration is available, receives a typed invalidation result or remains waiting for the specified migration; it does **not** cause the previous effect to be reissued. Delivering invalidation notifies every waiter while leaving the outstanding interaction represented until completion, acknowledged cancellation, or a defined recovery transition. Stale *pure* ready or failed entries can be recomputed. Effectful results remain records of their original occurrences, reusable only with the corresponding scope and certificate. Thus the safe fallback for an effectful invocation is not the unconditional stale-state restart of a pure producer." nil)
